<title>HUNGARY: Michelin's Hungary unit to set up HUF 6.8bln plant.</title>
<headline>Michelin's Hungary unit to set up HUF 6.8bln plant.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taurus Rt, the Hungarian unit of French tyremaker Michelin, will invest 6.8 billion forints ($34.8 million) in a new agricultural tyre plant, a government spokesman said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The plant will be set up in Nyiregyhaza, eastern Hungary, Elemer Kiss told a news conference.</p>
<p>He said the plant was likely to benefit from government plans to grant a 100 percent tax holiday for investments above three billion forints in less developed regions of Hungary.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
